---
description: Prepare one composeChecklist evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: PreparationContext[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Produce an accessible checklist using approved terminology and exact timing services. Adapt layout, language level, or format while preserving all clinical conditions; separate logistical suggestions from clinician instructions and flag unresolved questions visibly. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
